{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_title", "source_sha256": "1aa611c44962fa1fc678e46474ce2e9f5f841116b7da535fe826fe4a4893212c", "ja": "SUNRICH COLORFUL DAY1 留守電", "zh": "SUNRICH COLORFUL DAY1 留言电话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3e1c88d45261395288a99969ec4f0e83a35f8e5c08348f21d5dcf0593ec44bd9", "ja": "SUNRICH COLORFUL DAY1を無事に終えた\r\nあずさからの留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是顺利结束了SUNRICH COLORFUL DAY1的\n梓打来的留言电话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1000_010azu", "source_sha256": "b37234bd860372fa5f4c54a26c42c8b29f749522a6c91f9f33f2fc94b7d49df4", "ja": "もしもし～。{$P$}さん、\nこんばんは～。いらっしゃいませんか～？", "zh": "喂～。{$P$}先生，晚上好～。您在吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "9bc36296068db774f0b75fa52072a726685e96b9b262f22320f1017acbcd379a", "ja": "やっぱり、まだお忙しいのかしら……。\nすみません、留守番電話で失礼しますね。", "zh": "果然，您现在还是很忙吗……  \n不好意思，只能通过留言电话向您问候了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "b73478af830195f8692c919322bf2ec75ed5f35bd592143f5aa7dc3c5d764ea8", "ja": "改めまして……今日のライブ、お疲れ様でした。\nそして、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "再次向您道一声……今天的演出辛苦了。\n还有，谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "72432be0833fc7943b932bd6f95866a304b5ab2ab84ffcf72858518e0c59fd6f", "ja": "思い返せば、私が765プロに入って……\nそれから劇場ができて、かわいい後輩達もできて。", "zh": "回想起来，我加入765事务所之后……\n剧场也建成了，还拥有了一群可爱的后辈们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "12f915e15e9a5f2def47f3227d462a29bcaf3eb13bb7cde607ff0558a1a043c6", "ja": "毎日の公演や大きなステージで、\nたくさん歌わせてもらいましたね。", "zh": "每天的公演和大型舞台上，我也唱了好多歌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "e5db3b633039b01f55411bbe7248c7afc38dd31b7f4c2f1aabf66a4d333ccaff", "ja": "でも……今日のライブでもやっぱり、\n初めてのことがたくさんありました。", "zh": "但是……即使是今天的演唱会，果然也有很多第一次经历的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "c46af4de37d53f752850f45d9e1dbeba14e9b8b85af393bebe2841da13ca17b8", "ja": "初めてステージで歌う歌……\n初めてユニットで披露する歌……。", "zh": "第一次在舞台上演唱的歌曲……\n第一次以组合形式演出的歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "8c8b3702c783cce83e85ab9d890f79ca945506862ac2b65bcb0eae71afc73338", "ja": "まだまだ私の知らないこと、たくさん感じたい。\nもっとドキドキしたい。もっと挑戦してみたい……。", "zh": "我还想感受更多自己尚未了解的事物。\n还想更加心跳不已，还想挑战更多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "56797388474986a1a646f3058983d736487ab15bdf6557112dcbfad9c6125fc2", "ja": "{$P$}さんのおかげで、\n私はいつも、そんな体験をさせてもらっています。", "zh": "多亏了{$P$}先生，\n我一直都能有这样的体验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "490f8619ba3a12bd735929dd4d25ad379dcb980b3cdc4d37d273017935e5232c", "ja": "ですから、今日が終わる前にそのお礼を……と、\n思ったんですけれど。すれ違ってしまいました……。", "zh": "所以我本来想在今天结束前向您道谢……可是，还是和您错过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "cf49502f073981d79fd8584dfb20f617e9337ef8ee7c4a8a723d31bd41329fec", "ja": "あ、すみません、勝手に一人で喋ってしまって。\nこのお話はまた今度にしますね。", "zh": "啊，对不起，不小心自顾自地说起来了。\n这件事还是下次再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "af5d51df159af3db0f5c93699f11d5409592bf4adde57c28922960bc9dfa22a0", "ja": "やっぱり私、{$P$}さんの\nお顔を見ながらでないと、ダメみたいで……。", "zh": "我果然还是，要是不看着{$P$}先生的\n脸的话，就完全不行呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "2f872c835e965892363e310705abcd172d7dd19f67db66b2e61b01f7f18d76b0", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい、なんだか今、恥ずかしいことを\n言ってしまったような……今のは、忘れてくださいっ。", "zh": "啊，对不起，我好像说了什么很害羞的话……刚才那些，请忘掉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_506_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_506_rs_01_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "3265e8b5af86d3786ea0de3b4af8fc362c49224e86096771509306f0e053ea8c", "ja": "あ、でもこれ留守電……！\nど、どうしましょう～？　……、えいっ！", "zh": "啊，不过这是语音留言……！\n怎、怎么办呀～？……，按下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
